# Append-only verdict log written by linked-data/poc/hooks/gate-evidence.py.
# Deliberately untracked: it grows on every gated write and would conflict on
# every merge. When a line in it is a *finding* (a denial that caught something),
# quote it in linked-data/poc/reconciliation.md - the prose is the durable record.
linked-data/poc/hooks/gate-log.jsonl

# Editor swap files, which git mv leaves stranded when a tree is renamed.
.*.sw[a-p]
